+/*
+ * (1012) A deaf start: in 2 of ~30 boots with Bluetooth up (0980-btmetal-a, 0977-120-a) the
+ * firmware answered FW_FINISH early (426 and 116 ms, not the usual 710-790: its power-on
+ * calibration cut short) and then heard nothing at all, 2.4 or 5 GHz, for the whole boot. Such
+ * a start is restarted: WFSYS off (soc5_0.c wf_pwr_off_consys_mcu) and steps 4-6 again.
+ */
+static bool a34w_restarting;            /* steps 4 and 5 do not take "it already runs" then */
